# Session signing key for the Worker. At least 32 characters.
# Generate one with:
#   openssl rand -base64 32
# Put that value on the next line. Do not commit .dev.vars.
#
# Production uses a Worker secret, not this file:
#   openssl rand -base64 32 | npx wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET
#
# Google sign-in still uses the public client id in js/google-client.js.
# There is no Google client secret. Unsigned play works without SESSION_SECRET.
# Sign-in returns an error until the secret is set.
#
# To sign in from a local origin, add these authorized JavaScript origins
# on that same Google OAuth client:
#   http://127.0.0.1:8787
#   http://localhost:8787
#   https://murdoku-grid.mocholate.workers.dev
SESSION_SECRET=
